  "body": "Offering exceptional value, this much loved and cherished home, owned by one family for 15 years is ready for its next chapter. This stunning 1950s brick-and-tile home began as a modest original build, has been thoughtfully extended and renovated into an impressive 229m² modern family haven on a sprawling 809m² section. \r\n\r\nThe oversized kitchen offers exceptional space, perfect for reimagining into a chef's kitchen and the expansive living areas showcase views of the impressive heated pool and gazebo. The fully covered alfresco area serves as the ultimate year-round entertaining space - and the vast lawn space easily accommodates backyard cricket, football, and a trampoline. There are three bedrooms on this level - one with an en suite and the other two with a shared bathroom. A separate powder room provides extra convenience. \r\n\r\nDownstairs you’ll find a flexible area (currently set up as a gym, office and storage); a huge separate laundry; PLUS a self-contained area with its own lounge, kitchenette and bathroom - ideal for extended family, guests, or even as a rental. \r\n\r\nQuietly positioned near the end of a cul de sac with Glendowie Park just metres away. Numerous other parks are within easy access, along with beaches, amenities, sports facilities, cafes, shops; and it’s in zone for Glendowie College and Primary.\r\n \r\nMake memories. Entertain with ease. Live the life you’ve dreamed of. Call me!\r\n\r\nPlease visit www.barfoot.co.nz/938086 and scroll down to download or view: Title; LIM (where available); Particulars and Conditions of Sale by Auction (where applicable); and other informative documents",
